      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229088/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss apples with white sugar and ½ teaspoon cinnamon in a medium bowl to coat; pour into a 9-inch square baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DMbKXTKFs7ebhiGOLku49PgUH-I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-229088-Apple-Crisp-with-oat-topping-Step2-6f027b5164134775b31298fa7accdb8c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229088/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix brown sugar, oats, flour, and 1 teaspoon cinnamon in a separate bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q_EJfI7bC350GtYJVpuEg52MNf4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-229088-Apple-Crisp-with-oat-topping-Step3-b3e5c6ade0af44a5816393fd83d21c38.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229088/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut in cold butter with two knives or a pastry blender until the mixture resembles coarse crumbs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XXI6zhbj81WBq-FzwxQPhPWKsYQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-229088-Apple-Crisp-with-oat-topping-Step4-2d005e18a0fa450eb3a2a2278522640c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229088/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread over apples and pat down gently until even.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pOcq_hffwJQ41RFZo-ddWcVgNKA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-229088-Apple-Crisp-with-oat-topping-Step5-bdb8b95ac97c4c258e6c097b723fc723.jpg"
